ould have been this way","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":38,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I'd never looked at you, looked in the first place","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"  Was it always in your plan to leave eventually?","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"  Because to me, there's no one else that could make sense to me","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"The last and final puzzle piece","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"    In a room full of people, I look for you","columns":45,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":2,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":41,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Em","column":43,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Would you avoid me or would you look for me too?","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":44,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":46,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell me, is our story through? (through)","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Or do our hearts still beat in tune?","columns":36,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"section","text":"[Ponte]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"  Maybe I'm delusional","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"  And the way you act is usual","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0}]},{